WEBVTT

00:06.200 --> 00:07.600
Advance

00:07.720 --> 00:09.120
Is death

00:10.120 --> 00:11.520
Retreat

00:11.800 --> 00:13.200
Is also death

00:13.640 --> 00:15.307
Then we have no choice

00:15.560 --> 00:17.560
But to fight to the end

00:21.800 --> 00:22.160
Halt

00:22.320 --> 00:23.720
What are you doing?

00:28.400 --> 00:29.240
Can you reach?

00:29.320 --> 00:30.640
Can you reach?

00:30.720 --> 00:31.800
Don't waste words with him

00:31.880 --> 00:32.400
You, you

00:32.480 --> 00:33.840
Come

00:33.920 --> 00:35.320
Do the real work

00:41.240 --> 00:42.640
General Chen

00:43.800 --> 00:45.760
You dare kill a court minister

00:45.840 --> 00:46.800
This is rebellion

00:46.880 --> 00:47.640
Brothers

00:47.720 --> 00:49.240
Follow me to capture the rebels

00:49.400 --> 00:50.800
Return for reward

00:53.160 --> 00:54.560
This

00:54.920 --> 00:56.320
This

00:56.400 --> 00:58.000
What's going on?

00:59.640 --> 01:01.000
What should we do?

01:01.080 --> 01:02.080
What do we do?

01:02.160 --> 01:03.560
Quiet

01:17.200 --> 01:19.280
Yiyang Army, Beishuo Army, at attention

01:19.360 --> 01:20.520
Here
